When Red Hood heard sound of axes somewhere to the left from the trail, she ran towards it. The girl was very glad to see woodcutters and in a confused manner explained them what happened asking for help. Of course stout men could not deny assistance to a child.
- Show us the way! - sternly said one of them.
Once falling into sleep in the house on the forest edge Wolf did never wake up. No doubt woodcutters facilitated him in it. Grandmother was taken out alive and unharmed and afterwards sat down to have tea with pasties.
